•	Surge in Complex Surgeries: Growth in cardiovascular, orthopedic, and neurosurgical procedures drives the need for high-performance surgical lighting.
•	Hospital Infrastructure Investment: New operating room construction and modernization of older facilities support large-scale procurement cycles.
